                type: "paragraph",
                text: "Purpose: Give space to meaning and connection only if desired. Choose one low-intensity option: think of a value learned from the person, prepare a meal connected to a positive memory, or quietly reflect on something important in the relationship. Alternatively, skip memory work entirely and focus on present-day care.",
